&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video poster=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/thumbnail-violet.jpg&quot; controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;source src=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video%20(English).mp4&quot; type=&quot;video/mp4&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Your browser does not support the video tag.&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our culture is built on innovation, trust, and a drive to transform the insurance industry through our SaaS platform. We come from more than 50 different countries and cultures and together we are creating the future of insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.shift-technology.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.shift-technology.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a market-facing &lt;strong&gt;Sales Director for Germany&lt;/strong&gt; who leads from the front. You will be part of a team that works daily to grow Shift’s solutions new business revenue to Insurance carriers in the DACH region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The majority of your time will be spent &lt;strong&gt;personally driving revenue&lt;/strong&gt; — building pipeline, closing strategic deals, and expanding key accounts across the German &lt;strong&gt;insurance&lt;/strong&gt; market. You will operate as the most senior individual contributor in the region, owning both new logo acquisition and long-term account growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will focus on selling complex &lt;strong&gt;B2B software solutions&lt;/strong&gt; to insurance carriers across multiple lines of business (Fraud, Claims, Underwriting, Subrogation, etc.), combining strategic hunting with sophisticated farming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed for a seasoned sales executive who wants to &lt;strong&gt;personally drive impact in the German insurance market&lt;/strong&gt; while shaping the long-term commercial trajectory of a leading global insurtech company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for building and scaling revenue within the German insurance ecosystem by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning and executing the commercial strategy for the German market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally leading complex, enterprise-level sales cycles end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving new business acquisition (hunter mindset) within Tier 1–3 insurance carriers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanding and deepening existing client relationships (farmer mindset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging C-level and senior stakeholders on business transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading a team of specialists in their field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrating internal collaboration across Pre-Sales, Marketing, Partnerships, Delivery, and Customer Success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring strong value realization and long-term strategic partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining forecasting excellence and predictable revenue performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-visibility, high-autonomy role with direct impact on company growth in one of our most strategic markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE&#39;RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;senior, proven commercial leader&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong individual contributor track record.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of quota-carrying experience in B2B software or product sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of selling &lt;strong&gt;complex software solutions to insurance carriers&lt;/strong&gt; in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of the &lt;strong&gt;German insurance&lt;/strong&gt; landscape and buying processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;established network &lt;/strong&gt;within German insurance decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in both &lt;strong&gt;hunting &lt;/strong&gt;new logos and &lt;strong&gt;farming &lt;/strong&gt;strategic accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating long, enterprise-level sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a small team of senior talents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment, negotiation excellence, and deal strategy capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with the ability to influence C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence and the ability to manage complex internal and external dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native-level German and professional fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A senior sales professional who thrives in ownership and accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic thinker who also enjoys rolling up their sleeves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating independently while collaborating cross-functionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-driven with high standards and strong business acumen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energized by building markets and shaping long-term customer partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RECRUITMENT PROCESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 minutes with HR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;60 minutes with our Head of EMEA for GtM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute role-play exercise with 3 Shifters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;60 minutes with some members of our German team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-RH1 #LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;To support our permanent, full time employees at every stage of their careers and lives, we provide a competitive total rewards and benefits package. Here are the global benefits we’d like to highlight:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Flexible remote and hybrid working options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary and a variable component tied to personal and company performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Multiple Learning and Development opportunities, including Focus Fridays, a half-day each month to focus on learning and personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous PTO and paid holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Mental health benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;2 MAD Days per year (Make A Difference Days for paid volunteering)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Additional benefits may be offered by country, based on your eligibility - ask your recruiter for more information. Intern and Apprentice positions may receive some of these benefits - ask your recruiter for more details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI tools are used to help review applications for this role. Read our &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.shift-technology.com/hubfs/AI%20in%20Recruitment%20Notice%20May%202026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI in Recruitment Notice&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;for what the AI considers, how to request a human review, and our most recent bias audit.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Shift we strive to be a diverse and inclusive workforce. &lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We welcome applications from and hire people who will contribute to the diversity of our company,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;without regard to race, color, religion, marital status, age, national or ethnic origin, physical or mental disability, medical condition, pregnancy, genetic information, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, or other non-merit criteria. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our application and employment process. Should you require accommodation, please email ----- and we will work with you to meet your accessibility needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers and only trust correspondence that comes from emails ending in &quot;shift-technology.com&quot;. We will never do initial outreach to you via Whatsapp/Text/SMS, never ask for banking information or personal identification numbers (ex. Social Security Number) as part of our recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 8pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shift Technology does not accept unsolicited CVs from recruiters or employment agencies in response to the Shift Technology Careers page or a Shift Technology social media post. Any unsolicited CVs, including those submitted directly to hiring managers, are deemed to be the property of Shift Technology. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;130% YoY revenue growth and a 90% reduction in cash burn - culminating in our $1.15bn acquisition by Hims &amp;amp; Hers in 2026, giving us the platform to take long-term care global&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supported over 350k patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a talented Senior Product Designer with a passion for health and excitement about building our expanding healthcare platform. You enjoy working in dynamic environments, solving complex problems, and creating thoughtful, user-centred design solutions that make a real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a problem area across connected surfaces, not a queue of screens, from definition to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research it, design it, write it, test it, measure it, iterate. You drive it without waiting for a spec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move commercial outcomes on your surface: activation, conversion through regulated intake, retention, adherence. You know which metric you are moving and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create designs that build trust and hold up in a regulated market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What good looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope: &lt;/strong&gt;you own a problem area end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;you moved a meaningful metric and can show the before and after.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence: &lt;/strong&gt;you raise the bar around you. You give sharp critique. You make junior designers better without being asked to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you (who you are)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re a talented Senior Product Designer with a passion for health and excitement about building our expanding healthcare platform. You enjoy working in dynamic environments, solving complex problems, and creating thoughtful, user-centred design solutions that make a real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem definition. &lt;/strong&gt;You shape the problem, not just the pixels. Using research, data and the input of others, you break the ambiguity down and package it back up into something the team can build. The signal is evidence you helped define the right problem, not just made the screens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visual craft.&lt;/strong&gt; Non-negotiable. Typography, spacing, colour, motion and micro-interactions, used with intent, not decoration. Weak craft is a no, whatever the strategy talk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accessibility. &lt;/strong&gt;You design inclusively without being asked. You know why the standard exists, not just what it says, and it shows in judgement calls a checklist cannot make.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinking. &lt;/strong&gt;You design across surfaces, from mobile to emerging platforms like AI-native interfaces, and contribute to the system others build on. Infrastructure compounds. Single screens do not.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product and commercial sense. &lt;/strong&gt;You shaped what got built. Metrics, research and commercial awareness sit next to the work. Craft in isolation moves nothing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication. &lt;/strong&gt;Clear, specific, opinionated. You say what you decided and why, and you are just as clear on what you chose not to do and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working in the open. &lt;/strong&gt;You share early and often, and you use critique to sharpen the work. You lift the quality of every review you join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you work with AI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LLMs are already embedded in your workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prototype in tools like Claude Code and Cursor to test ideas in real code, not just mock them up. Tighter build-measure-learn loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The signal is workflow, not tool count. Judgement spent where it counts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The full stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect you to work end to end, from problem definition and research to information architecture and UX writing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your own research and usability testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validation and experimentation. You set up A/B tests and read them honestly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UX writing. In a regulated market, this is craft and compliance at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem definition. Break it down. Package it back up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Show problem solving that moved a commercial lever, not just well-made screens. We want evidence of the outcome, the craft behind it, the care in the finish, how you contributed to the Design System, and where AI tightened your process. How you write it says as much as what you show. Concise and clear is a signal of how you communicate. Applications without a portfolio will not be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typically 5 to 8 years in product design, with a track record of owning problems end to end and influencing direction at a team level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviours &amp;amp; attitude&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Patient-first mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You put patient outcomes first. Every decision weighs commercial growth against clinical safety and care, and you don&#39;t let one erode the other. You understand real health journeys well enough to make them simple, accessible and worth trusting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative creation. &lt;/strong&gt;You work well across product, engineering and clinical, and you know a good idea can come from any of them. You listen to feedback and take it on, using it to make the work better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity. &lt;/strong&gt;You ask why before how. You stay curious about the patient, the problem and the tools you use to solve it, and you&#39;re comfortable being a beginner when something new is worth learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, and skincare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity to convert to an FTE role&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become an owner&lt;/strong&gt; – Your own stake in the business with our employee options program&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work mo

