&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with CSOC tools such as Rapid7 InsightIDR or other SIEM solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience in internal and external audits, compliance assessments, and process improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of incident response frameworks and cybersecurity best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
