&lt;li&gt;Establish the benchmark for data quality and governance — expectations, data contracts, lineage, validation frameworks — and hold the team to it through building and code review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the most complex, ambiguous initiatives that span multiple quarters and teams, from problem statement to delivered capability.&lt;/li&gt;
