&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Are you ready to take your career to the next level and play a pivotal role in shaping the future of a fast-growing, innovative company? Rubrik is seeking an Senior Analyst, Sales Strategy &amp;amp; Planning to join our high-performing Sales Strategy and Operations team. In this role, you’ll be at the strategic core of our organization, driving the sales planning strategy, processes, and innovations needed to scale our Go-to-Market (GTM) operations as we accelerate our growth in International markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to lead high-impact initiatives in a cross-functional environment across finance, sales and field operations, solve complex challenges to drive our GTM strategies with exposure to senior executives.&amp;nbsp;If you are a strategic thinker with strong analytical skills and thrive in fast-paced environments, we want to hear from you. Join us on our mission to revolutionize the way enterprises protect, manage, and unlock the power of their data.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Shape GTM Strategy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead analyses supporting the annual and quarterly planning cycles, revenue targets, headcount allocation, quota modeling, segmentation, and coverage design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the analytics and develop tools / models to support the annual planning cycles such as territory planning and quota allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate long-term business strategy into concrete, executable GTM plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Deliver Insight That Drives Decisions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harness your analytical expertise to assess key performance metrics, create deep-dive analyses, and identify opportunities to elevate the sales organization including building QBR and other executive facing materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop impactful dashboards, reports, and presentations that provide actionable insights into the health of the business, with a focus on areas that can unlock exponential growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Execute with Precision, Drive Innovation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with operational teams (e.g., Field Operations and Sales Compensation) to translate GTM plans into action, ensuring seamless implementation of changes and continuous process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a mindset of innovation, continually challenging the status quo to identify smarter ways to achieve business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who You Are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Visionary&lt;/strong&gt;: You excel at leveraging data to solve complex business challenges and can translate numbers into compelling narratives. You think strategically but analyze tactically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Influencer&lt;/strong&gt;: You thrive in cross-functional environments and can work effectively across different levels of the organization, building trust and aligning stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Problem-Solver&lt;/strong&gt;: Fast-paced environments excite you, and you are energized by ambiguity. You identify patterns where others see chaos and have the determination to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Communicator&lt;/strong&gt;: Whether communicating with executives or working with front-line teams, you can distill complex ideas into clear, concise messages that inspire action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in sales strategy and operations, strategy consulting, analytics, investment banking or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead cross-functional initiatives and deliver results in a dynamic, fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to influence senior leaders and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical skills with fluency in tools with a proven ability to analyze and synthesize large datasets into actionable insights. (SQL, Tableau, Pigment, Snowflake expertise a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superb organizational and project management skills with a keen focus on prioritization and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset and a relentless drive for excellence and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A./B.S. Degree, MBA is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in forecasting, territory planning, TAM and account propensity analysis a plu&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in high-tech industry, preferably in hyper-growth, cloud-based technology businesses a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/rubrik-inc/mycompany/verification/&quot;&gt;Linkedin&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/rubrikinc&quot;&gt;X (formerly Twitter)&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/rubrikinc/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; |&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.rubrik.com&quot;&gt;Rubrik.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Inclusion @ Rubrik&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Rubrik, we are dedicated to fostering a culture where people from all backgrounds are valued, feel they belong, and believe they can succeed. Our commitment to inclusion is at the heart of our mission to secure the world’s data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our goal is to hire and promote the best talent, regardless of background. We continually review our hiring practices to ensure fairness and strive to create an environment where every employee has equal access to opportunities for growth and excellence. We believe in empowering everyone to bring their authentic selves to work and achieve their fullest potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our inclusion strategy focuses on three core areas of our business and culture:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Company: We are committed to building a merit-based organization that offers equal access to growth and success for all employees globally. Your potential is limitless here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Culture: We strive to create an inclusive atmosphere where individuals from all backgrounds feel a strong sense of belonging, can thrive, and do their best work. Your contributions help us innovate and break boundaries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;Our Communities: We are dedicated to expanding our engagement with the communities we operate in, creating opportunities for underrepresented talent and driving greater innovation for our clients. Your impact extends beyond Rubrik, contributing to safer and stronger communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer/Veterans/Disabled&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, or protected veteran status and will not be discriminated against on the basis of disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik provides equal employment opportunities (EEO) to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability or genetics. In addition to federal law requirements, Rubrik complies with applicable state and local laws governing nondiscrimination in employment in every location in which the company has facilities. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Federal law requires employers to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities. Please contact us at ----- if you require a reasonable accommodation to apply for a job or to perform your job. Examples of reasonable accommodation include making a change to the application process or work procedures, providing documents in an alternate format, using a sign language interpreter, or using specialized equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO IS THE LAW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/olms/regs/compliance/eo_posters/employeerightsposter2page_19final.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;NOTIFICATION OF EMPLOYEE RIGHTS UNDER FEDERAL LABOR LAWS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mid-Market Senior Manager UK/I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;Location: London UK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced sales leader to manage a team of Mid-Market Account Executives based in London (covering UKI). You should bring a proven track record of success in generating pipeline, achieving sales targets, and experience in motivating teams through leadership, coaching, and team-building skills.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik’s Inside Sales Team forms the core of our ambitious go to market strategy and revenue growth engine. As a Mid-Market Regional Director you will manage &amp;amp; mentor a team to drive new customer acquisition by owning full-cycle sales processes for small to mid-sized accounts in a given territory. We are seeking relentless self-starters who will work closely with Sales Engineers and Channel Partners to exceed sales quotas by discovering and developing new opportunities, managing pipeline, and executing account strategies. Rubrik’s Inside Sales Organization strives to develop All-Star talent by providing training on sales processes and strategies to help your team become successful field Account Executives in the future.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop a team of Account Executives including recruiting, hiring, and enablement of team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in strategic and tactical planning for the region and a key member of the EMEA Management team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accurate team forecasting practice in line with management expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development of short, medium, and long term plans to achieve strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly interact across functional areas with senior management or executives to ensure region objectives are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence thinking or gain acceptance of others in sensitive situations is important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow the weekly cadence of forecast and pipeline with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach sales and related staff members on a daily base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute sales plans for the assigned territory to meet and exceed quota through prospecting, qualifying, managing, and closing sales opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and manage sales pipeline to move a large number of strategic transactions through the sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and close new opportunities for growth working with a mix of mid market accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present Rubrik, Inc. solutions within complex data center design environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-sell and strategize with partners, distributors, and VAR’s to enable rapid growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Rubrik, Inc. management with feedback about the local market opportunity and identification of new business opportunities and channel partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience You’ll Need&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a dynamic high pressure environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polished written and presentation skills with a high degree of comfort engaging with senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sales management and coaching skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotionally intelligent: Self-aware, hard-working, and humble&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New business focussed with a clear concise method to pipeline generation activities&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A minimum of 2+ years of experience leading / managing a sales team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in tech sales - we want leaders who will lead and inspire their team with experienced knowledge of the tech industry&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Salesforce.com, Salesloft&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; LinkedIn Navigator&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge in top of the funnel sales processes and strategy&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally a bachelors degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally trained / use MEDDPICC as sales qualification tool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Sales team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik’s Sales organization is a united group of elite cross-functional sales professionals that help companies &amp;amp; government entities achieve resilience against cyberattacks, malicious insiders, and operational disruptions. We offer continuous professional growth and opportunity&amp;nbsp; through our world-class sales enablement program. Our One Rubrik selling approach provides all the resources you need to exceed your goals, maximize your earnings potential, and take your career to the next level. All this while doing something truly purposeful, protecting the world&#39;s data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join Us in Securing and Accelerating the World&#39;s AI Transformation&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rubrik (RBRK), the Security and AI Operations Company, leads at the intersection of data protection, cyber resilience, and enterprise AI acceleration. Rubrik Security Cloud delivers complete cyber resilience by securing, monitoring, and recovering data, identities, and workloads across clouds. Rubrik Agent Cloud accelerates trusted AI agent deployments at scale by monitoring and auditing agentic actions, enforcing real-time guardrails, fine-tuning for accuracy and undoing agentic mistakes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
